{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610301941178681014948268d9d6kLbIbO7G","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_9745712fd07f4ff2a32bb61cddbf0ff1","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const foundationsPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes('Foundations'));\nif (!foundationsPage) {\n  return \"Foundations page not found\";\n}\n\nconst getDetailedNodeInfo = (node) => {\n  return {\n    id: node.id,\n    name: node.name,\n    type: node.type,\n    x: node.x,\n    y: node.y,\n    width: node.width,\n    height: node.height,\n    fills: node.fills,\n    strokes: node.strokes,\n    characters: node.type === 'TEXT' ? node.characters : undefined,\n    children: 'children' in node ? node.children.map(getDetailedNodeInfo) : undefined\n  };\n};\n\nreturn foundationsPage.children.map(getDetailedNodeInfo);","description":"Deep extract Foundations visual guidelines and color swatches","fileKey":"yxXcYheOJMwoQleZezxzb8"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":39005,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d7838db2-841a-44dc-a76d-94e0a765d60f","uuid":"46cc3f43-eb9d-403e-9185-0e8c620c87d4","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:41:22.435Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_9745712fd07f4ff2a32bb61cddbf0ff1","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
